SUMMARY:UC Davis Global Learning Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the UC Davis Global Learning Fair to learn about the variety of global opportunities and funding resources available to you. Hosted by the Global Learning Hub\, the fair is comprised of in-person global leadership opportunities\, study abroad programs\, global internships\, post-graduate global opportunities\, funding for global learning programs and more! \n\nWhen:  October 8\, 2026\, 10 a.m.–3 p.m.\nWhere: UC Davis ARC Recreation Center\, Ballroom A&B\, 760 Orchard Road\, Directions\nQuestions? Email globallearningfair@ucdavis.edu
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/uc-davis-global-learning-fair/
LOCATION:UC Davis ARC\, 760 Orchard Road\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/UC-Davis-Global-Learning-Fair-2026-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
